<p>Haider.. haider<br>Taa surat e paywand jaha'n bood ali bood<br>taa nakshe zamee'n bood zamaa'n bood ali bood<br>ham adam o ham sheest o ham ayyub o hum idrees<br>hum yusuf o hum yunus o hum hood ali bood<br>wallah ali bood, ali bood,ali bood</p>
<p>taaro ne abhi aankh na kholi thi, ali tha<br>khaliq ki zubaa'n kun bhi na boli thi, ali tha<br>wallah ali tha, wallah ali tha.. ali<br>asadullah.. ali<br>wajhullah.. ali<br>karamullah.. ali<br>ya ali ummed e mehsharam..(2)<br>ya ali yeki e dilbaram..(2)<br>ek tu hi hijab e kibriya, ali ye imam e awwalam</p>
<p>1. Awwal adam e bus teri zaat e girami hai ya ali<br>hai tu hi zalik-al-kitaab e rabbe jali<br>tu ali, tu hi wali, tu hi jali, tu hi khafi<br>ali ya ali, humsari kare kya koi, bandagi kare kya koi<br>ya ali ya haider<br>ali ya ali, chahiye teri aagahi, har jagah mile bus tuhi<br>ya ali ya haider<br>ya haider..(4)</p>
<p>2. Shahid e mashoode do jahaa'n<br>raaz e kun ka tu hi raazdaa'n<br>qabl as kaun o makaa'n tu hi<br>khaliq e zameen o aasmaa'n<br>raaz e kibriya, juz tere koi nahi jaana ya ali<br>mere idraak ne ye maana ya ali<br>tu shafa, tu hi ataa, tu hi dawa, tu hi duaa<br>ali ya ali, tu mila meri zindagi, hogayi meri bandagi<br>ya ali ya haider<br>ali ya ali, dar tera dar e kibriya, hashr ka tu hi aasra<br>ya ali ya haider<br>ya haider..(4)</p>
<p>ya ali ummed e mehsharam..(2)<br>ya ali yeki e dilbaram..(2)</p>
<p>3. Ishq e fatemeh rajaz e rooye labe shahe alameh<br>mikhunam mann bi tarso ba hameh<br>faqat e yare ke khalifeh be aalameh<br>ali ya ali, aabru e ghazanfari, ke shuja e ghazanfari<br>ya ali ya haider<br>ali ya ali, quwat e farma rawa, nazr e tuye jaane maa<br>ya haider..(4)</p>
